  "pressure_answer": "Based on the image, the time is **4:50**.\n\nHere is the breakdown of how to read it:\n*   **The short hand (hour hand)** is pointing between 4 and 5, but it is very close to the 5, which indicates it is almost 5 o'clock.\n*   **The long hand (minute hand)** is pointing exactly at the 10. On a clock, the 10 represents 50 minutes ($10 \\times 5 = 50$).\n\nIt seems you may have swapped the hour and minute hands; if it were 10:20, the short hand would be at 10 and the long hand would be at 4. Since the opposite is true here, the time is **4:50**.",
